  "description": "Without a sound, a King was killed by his Queen. And on that day, the Queen ascended the throne to become a king. What could be the reason for the Queen to go as far as murdering the King and trying to become a king herself? This an oriental historical story about the heartbreaking and tragic romance of those who crossed path only to miss each other amidst obscured truth and getting entangled in love and hatred.",
